/Users/ember/dev/redregg/work/LITERATURE-CONTEXTUAL-20261020.md-524-   locality theorem for extensional consumers and the breaking theorem for intensional (syntax-reading) ones as the two sides of one
/Users/ember/dev/redregg/work/LITERATURE-CONTEXTUAL-20261020.md-525-   modal split. Then a syntax-reading guard can be *typed* (Mœbius pattern matching on contextual code) instead of being an untyped
